&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;background&#34;&gt;Background&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;background&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#background&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;ShardingSphere-JDBC supports all database JDBC drivers and connection pools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This section describes how to configure data sources through the &lt;code&gt;JAVA API&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;procedure&#34;&gt;Procedure&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;procedure&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#procedure&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
